{"id":1237,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>4月27日，“中北·北阳”-“大手拉小手”美育浸润共同体活动正式拉开帷幕，中北大学与太谷区胡村镇北阳联校携手搭建美育共建桥梁，以艺术为媒，助力乡村孩子发现美、感受美、创造美，推动优质美育资源下沉乡村校园。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enRUysUmQ2LN-8nhzr7U8UDUNW2LzN3Pn7CPMR-bMlUZU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0okyPM1hfM1h7LzQRnzlPMNlPozNaLl7DUzV2UlCPM8Q7L4rFMzNDL7L4nmfFMzMfnzNJqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLz70LmGiLzlJqdBnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/816A6D16CE516E19901A6A1FAF17FD35/5960C3F0/53AE9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLRTy2L4rVnlrfnh7LPL4CPU8LDLmM3fo7LYoRvanlV2ozv0gihFp2hmCIa0M1y4UShVMkyPnNVfMR6fU4NiUm-YUNr2UllbM49iLRvPL7VFozTfL8WRnmTFL49aLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4xJQ56AvjU0qIbtpYyYLR7Pg4-aMz7igtA8pUBcc&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.jpg\"></p></div><div><p>活动伊始，太谷区教研室主任秦安东，太谷区胡村镇中心校校长韩建忠，太谷区胡村镇北阳联校校长杨建兵，中北大学艺术学院院长王燕平、党委副书记刘晓玲等嘉宾齐聚一堂，共襄美育盛举。致辞环节中，各级领导与嘉宾分别表达了对此次美育共建合作的美好期许，北阳联校校长杨建兵传递出对孩子们的关爱与对美育事业的热忱，中北大学艺术学院院长王燕平为共建工作指明方向，太谷区教育局党组书记、局长贾瑞兵提出殷切嘱托，为双方合作注入信心与力量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLmfyVLzUPoRvYMh7laU8nfLmU4nmL3bUz98MNUDUz9sUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhknkhRn1yaL46fLl-8U8-snmLDnNUYnzLYU4Lanmv8L8nFoRTRMzW7Uz6FL8LPUz7Jqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLz70LmGiLzlJqdBnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CBDCF037A1B4CB7F36FD2E32C30F743D/89C52DA7/3C1A1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eM8Wy7UlW2nRGYLh8lYU4WkMRr7o7V37Lzf7L77PoRLDUlC0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiMYhVLYh2nRN8Mzv4MRV2L7-PnmnkUzlYnmMfMRUsUmVFnRMfMl7sUmQFL47aLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4xJQ56AvjU0qIbtpYyYLR7Pg4-aMz7igtA8pUBcc&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.jpg\"></p></div><div><p>随后，中北大学艺术学院院长王燕平与北阳联校校长杨建兵共同为中北大学艺术学院美育实践基地揭牌，搭建起高校服务地方美育发展的实践平台，为美育合作筑牢坚实根基，为乡村美育教育发展注入蓬勃动力，实现育人成才与服务社会的双向奔赴。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUzLyZn7LYMRLZnhNCiL8U4Uml8LzT3kLNUsLRUZUz9Pnm90gihFp2hmCIa0nSyZokhVLYyZMN-PM7VfU87ZL4ffoz7sLlLPnmVfLm78MzVFMlQRoRAkLRWFMzW7M8UJqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLz70LmGiLzlJqdBnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E88E386B14AACA830A9171C1F1A21451/5FC88B02/52D7D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUm-y8M498nRUPMhzfVL4-Pnzv4L493aLlCanNWRL8UsMl70gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2LYhfUSyiUlCaUmv8LRNsMlM7oz98M7n2UzQVnRGsU4fFLzC8LzliUNrFL8UZLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4xJQ56AvjU0qIbtpYyYLR7Pg4-aMz7igtA8pUBcc&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div><div><p>活动期间，中北大学志愿者提前深入教室开展前置教学，围绕音乐、舞蹈、剪纸等艺术形式，为孩子们带来丰富多元的美育课程。音乐课堂上，孩子们唱响经典曲目，在欢快旋律中感受艺术魅力；美术课堂上，孩子们用画笔描摹美好、用彩纸创作手工作品，在实践中提升审美与动手能力；舞蹈课堂上，孩子们在志愿者的带领下舒展肢体、踏着节拍起舞，展现童年活力。此外，小朋友们还献上了《北京喜讯到边寨》民乐演奏、葫芦丝合奏串烧等精彩表演，将现场气氛推向高潮。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eoRMyRUlrRLNCDnhNWfL4NZL4Caozv3DL4NbM8VkLmM7LRU0gihFp2hmCIa0oShVnkysUShVMRr2LRrVnNCYL4Q7MNnkn7C8UlCYoRnRMzWFUmGZnmC8nRVFoznkoRCJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLz70LmGiLzlJqdBnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9ED7AE45F05EFF236D6DBDF4AF284C52/B08F64D1/94B86\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enm9yPMzLinmCPMhmLaM8MkU467o7l3ZLRl4LlUiLN7Pol-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hVn1ybnkysM878nzCiL4NbU46RnmlYM7UaoR9sLN7YM4nFM4UYnmQ2UmfFLz9aLm62gjfJQ4Oeo4xJQ56AvjU0qIbtpYyYLR7Pg4-aMz7igtA8pUBcc&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.png\"></p></div><div><p>此次活动不仅为乡村孩子带来了生动有趣的艺术体验，更在高校与地方之间架起了美育共建的坚实桥梁。据悉，双方将以本次活动为起点，持续推动优质美育资源下沉，构建常态化、长效化美育帮扶机制，让艺术教育的阳光照亮乡村孩子的成长之路。活动尾声，全体参与师生登台合影，定格这一意义非凡的时刻，“中北·北阳”大手拉小手美育浸润共同体活动在温馨氛围中圆满落幕。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eoz9ybozLPLl7YohzG8L4vaL4T7MzG3ZnR7aMRGiolC8n7L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1h2LYybM1h2LmCYoRvDLRliU4GZLRfRLln7UznVMlMfo7rFozN8UNrkMR6FMzUbMlUJqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLz70LmGiLzlJqdBnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BF396F262876055C0800C1DDA4E5CA8E/994BEB47/5495D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eoz-yDU8UZMl-8Lh87iM7U8nNLZUl73sM4MRM7QRnNlZLRL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhRL1yiMkh7o7n7nmlbnz74MlLbMl-sUzrRLzv4n7MfMlrFM87sM7QRLm6FL4NZLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4xJQ56AvjU0qIbtpYyYLR7Pg4-aMz7igtA8pUBcc&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://art.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enRUysUmQ2LN-8nhzr7U8UDUNW2LzN3Pn7CPMR-bMlUZU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0okyPM1hfM1h7LzQRnzlPMNlPozNaLl7DUzV2UlCPM8Q7L4rFMzNDL7L4nmfFMzMfnzNJqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLz70LmGiLzlJqdBnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2011&nid=20515&e=.jpg"}